  "question": {
    "text": "A particle executes S.H.M. with amplitude <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math>&nbsp;and time period <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>T</mi></math>. The displacement of the particle when its speed is half of maximum speed is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt><mi>A</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>.</mo></math>&nbsp;The value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math> is",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "3",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#969;</mi><msqrt><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>max</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>&#969;</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>&#969;</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>&#969;</mi><msqrt><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>A</mi></math></p>",
